From 75c40a6f1aedfa7b4bea078609b27907e6fae853 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 20:12:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] osk: Microphone key for speech to text

A key left of the space bar starts and stops dictation through the
plinius-dictate session service (org.plinius.Dictate1). Recognized text
is committed to the focused field like typed text. The key is only shown
when dictation is switched on (org.plinius.dictate enabled) and the field
is a normal text field: not for passwords, PINs, numbers, terminals or
fields with sensitive data.

The key is a generic action key (use 'action', property 'action-name')
that activates an action in the 'win' group. It stays in the layout and
gets a width of 0 while hidden, so switching it on or off needs no new
layout.
